      "content": "It's exhausting to keep trying when the world already seems to have written you out of the story. That feeling of being a mistake is a very real, very heavy thing, and it's not something you have to fight through by trying harder. If the effort to be seen is just too much, maybe the only true relief is to stop trying to perform for everyone else. Sometimes, the most honest thing you can do is just let yourself stop moving, just for a little while.",
